  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x4F3E" flags="0x0">
    <title>Accelerator Pedal High-State Hysteresis</title>
    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x8E50; 1 rows x 2 columns; uint16; map confidence candidate. Two-word activation/release hysteresis for a normalized dual-channel accelerator-pedal analog quantity. FUN 00047a56 compares current sample ffff266e with cell 0 when previous-cycle state ffff246d bit 7 is clear and with cell 1 when that state is set, then writes current state ffff246a bit 7. Scheduler 00020dfe copies ffff246a to ffff246d once per cycle. The stock activation and release thresholds are 610 and 528 counts. The input is produced from on-chip A/D channels AN10 and AN17 through dual-channel adjustment and minimum selection. Exact JK08A diagnostic paths expose the paired accelerator-pedal sensors as DID 0x120D/0x120E and monitor them through P2122/P2123/P2127/P2128. The operational high-state role is proven; a narrower WOT or kickdown interpretation is not asserted. Definition address projected from JK08A 00008fdc through JK08A-1ND.definition-addresses.csv: homologous pedal-state consumer preserves the 610 and 528 threshold pair.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="4" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0" flags="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>Selector</units>
      <indexcount>2</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>0</decimalpl>
      <outputtype>1</outputtype>
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <LABEL index="0" value="activate" />
      <LABEL index="1" value="release" />
      <MATH equation="X">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="y" uniqueid="0x0" flags="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>Series</units>
      <indexcount>1</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>0</decimalpl>
      <outputtype>1</outputtype>
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <LABEL index="0" value="0" />
      <MATH equation="X">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
