  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xBCDA" flags="0x0">
    <title>VVEL Command Word - Shaft Angle Conversion, Second Copy</title>
    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x1B65E; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Second copy of the shaft-angle conversion, read only by FUN_00058964: it converts the two measured control-shaft angle words 0xFFFE977A and 0xFFFE977C to the command-word domain and publishes the mean of the two results times 1/512 as the float 0xFFFEF178 for FUN_00057C94. Exact 1ND3B target-native table at 0x1b65e bound to accessor 0x58964 through literal 0x58b04. Read by FUN_00058964 at callsites 0x58976 and 0x5898A through the 16-point uint16 wrapper 0x28B2C of the kernel 0x28FC8; the primary conversion 0x00015C22 goes through the wrapper 0x2893C. FUN_00057C94 is the only caller and the only reader of the float. The two argument words are the measured angles that the deficit monitors FUN_000DFFE6 subtract from the floor maximum. Stock bytes are identical to the primary table 0x00015C22.</description>
