  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x4D43" flags="0x0">
    <title>VVEL Idle Model - Duration Floor [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x17272; 1 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Duration floor of the VVEL idle-model stage FUN_0005FD88 at 1/512 per count, looked up by engine speed over the axis 0x00017252. The stage engages the floor in VVEL mode 5 while the model duration does not exceed it and blends the idle-model duration toward max(duration, floor) by the floor weight. Exact 1ND3B target-native table at 0x17272 bound to accessor 0x5fd88 through literal 0x5fe50. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x/512 deg; proposed editor-grid inverse x*512. Origin: on JK78C 0x00016C64, the float literal 1/512 at 0x56F4C. Recorded code interpretation: Read by FUN_0005FD88 through the literal-pool word 0x0005FE50, loaded at 0x0005FDAC. FUN_0005FD88 holds the float literals of JK78C FUN_00056DCA. Stock bytes are identical to JK78C 0x00016C64. 1ND3B shares the 1ND0A code layout and its stock bytes at this address. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
