    <title>VVEL Idle Model - Floor Hold Passes [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x172F2; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Pass count of the full idle-model floor weight in FUN_0005FD88, looked up by the demand margin over the axis 0x000171E2; afterwards the weight steps down by 0x000171F2 per pass. Exact 1ND3B target-native table at 0x172f2 bound to accessor 0x5fd88 through literal 0x6009c. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x passes; proposed editor-grid inverse x. Origin: on JK78C 0x00016D04, the counter comparison in FUN_00056DCA. Recorded code interpretation: Read by FUN_0005FD88 through the literal-pool word 0x0006009C, loaded at 0x0005FF66. FUN_0005FD88 holds the float literals of JK78C FUN_00056DCA. Stock bytes are identical to JK78C 0x00016D04. 1ND3B shares the 1ND0A code layout and its stock bytes at this address. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
