    <title>VVEL Idle Model - Floor Release Step [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x171F2; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Per-pass decrement of the idle-model floor weight in FUN_0005FD88 after the hold of 0x000172F2, looked up by the demand margin over the axis 0x000171E2; the full weight is 10000. Exact 1ND3B target-native table at 0x171f2 bound to accessor 0x5fd88 through literal 0x600a4. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x/10000 of the full weight; proposed editor-grid inverse x. Origin: on JK78C 0x00016BE4, the weight literal 10000 at 0x57068. Recorded code interpretation: Read by FUN_0005FD88 through the literal-pool word 0x000600A4, loaded at 0x0005FF76. FUN_0005FD88 holds the float literals of JK78C FUN_00056DCA. Stock bytes are identical to JK78C 0x00016BE4. 1ND3B shares the 1ND0A code layout and its stock bytes at this address. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
