  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x67FB" flags="0x0">
    <title>VVEL Duration State Word - Idle Model and Running [stored count]</title>
    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x10648; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Duration state word of the VVEL idle-model and running state codes in the state-code dispatcher FUN_00070514, looked up by engine speed over the axis 0x00017292 and by load over the axis 0x00017232. Exact 1ND3B target-native table at 0x10648 bound to accessor 0x70514 through literal 0x71028. Engineering conversion is unestablished. Retained hypothesis: x*0.05 deg; proposed editor-grid inverse x/0.05. Origin: on JK78C 0x000100CE, the 0.05 duration scale of the state words in defs/analysis/valve-timing/JK78C.vvel.md. Recorded code interpretation: Read by FUN_00070514 through the literal-pool word 0x00071028, loaded at 0x00070EA8. FUN_00070514 is the state-code dispatcher at the position of JK78C FUN_000657E4. Stock bytes differ from JK78C 0x000100CE: 660..1440. 1ND3B shares the 1ND0A code layout and its stock bytes at this address. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
