  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x6CCE" flags="0x0">
    <title>End of Injection Angle - Conditional</title>
    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x16560; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Conditionally selected end-of-injection angle over the engine-speed axis of the base curve. The injection writer interpolates the eight uint16 cells and stores 2*min(y, 209) of the interpolated value y, without correction bytes, to the end-of-injection word, the delay in 2 crank degrees per count from the reference tooth of the scheduled channel to the end of the pulse. A cell of x counts ends the pulse 4*x - 590 degrees after the following intake TDC, as a cell of JK08A 0001230a does. Exact 1ND3B target-native table at 0x16560 bound to accessor 0x7f4e0 through literal 0x7f9d0. Writer 0007f4e0 loads the curve from literal 0007f9d0 for the call at 0007f824 to wrapper 00028910 on axis 00016550 and engine-speed word fffe81b6, and stores twice the clamped value to fffe89a2.</description>
