    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x9DE0; 8 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Implicit 8x8 byte upper-bound surface of FUN_000690AC. ROM8[00008968].bit7 and ffff241f.bit1 gate the lookup by byte ffff11d7 and min(255,2*uint8[ffff1042]); result-128 is cached at ffff1f78 and limits the signed intermediate before ffff12be is written. Stock ROM8[00008968]=0x80 enables the calibration gate. Exact 1ND3B target-native table at 0x9de0 bound to accessor 0x741d8 through literal 0x7466c. Stock lookup status: active. ROM8[00008a2e] = 0x80 has bit 7 set, so the event-timing reader samples this upper bound. Applying the sampled bound to the result still depends on its RAM state flag. Stored counts are retained. Physical quantities and engineering conversions are unresolved. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
