    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x115C8; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Base surface of the affine-pair builder in the float producer tree. The reader applies nominal -300 + raw*0.01 and combines the result with a separately looked-up gain and byte-scaled term. Exact 1ND3B target-native table at 0x115c8 bound to accessor 0x61076 through literal 0x611d8. Stock lookup status: active. Scheduler entry 00022194 calls the float model root 00060756; reader 00061076 reads this role without a calibration branch. The root publishes the words fffea43c, fffea43e, fffea566 and fffea752 to the consumer 00061b28, whose output byte fffe9400 nonlinear_transition_controller and four other functions read. Stored counts are retained. Physical quantities and engineering conversions are unresolved. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
