    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0xBE40; 8 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Parameter surface of the ratio-response builder. The reader applies nominal v=1.2+raw*0.000004 and derives the ratio coordinate (v-1)/v for a separate response surface. This arithmetic does not establish a thermodynamic interpretation. Exact 1ND3B target-native table at 0xbe40 bound to accessor 0x61120 through literal 0x614b0. Stock lookup status: active. Scheduler entry 00022194 calls the float model root 00060756; reader 00061120 reads this role without a calibration branch. The root publishes the words fffea43c, fffea43e, fffea566 and fffea752 to the consumer 00061b28, whose output byte fffe9400 nonlinear_transition_controller and four other functions read. Stored counts are retained. Physical quantities and engineering conversions are unresolved. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
