    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x15162; 1 rows x 32 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Scaled word factor paired with the affine factor in the attenuated-product and product-branch builders. Its own float-derived coordinate is bounded independently before lookup. Exact 1ND3B target-native table at 0x15162 bound to accessor 0x61b28 through literal 0x61e18, accessor 0x62194 through literal 0x62400. Stock lookup status: active. Scheduler entry 0002219c runs 000736f4, which calls the float consumer 00061b28 unconditionally at 00073806; readers 00061b28 and 00062194 read this role without a calibration branch. The consumer publishes byte fffe9400, which nonlinear_transition_controller and four other functions read. Stored counts are retained. Physical quantities and engineering conversions are unresolved. Editor values are stored counts; no engineering conversion is established.</description>
