    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x13C22; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence code. Alternate warm DFCO-transition eight-point timing-state addend. It shares the index byte and the interpolator of the projected default table and is selected when the transition-completion latch is set. Common-definition Map 1 uses the canonical stock storage. Exact 1ND3B target-native table at 0x13c22 bound to accessor 0x6f37a through literal 0x6f6fc. Both eight-point branches read the same index byte, so neither carries an engine-bank identity. The selector is the transition-completion latch: it sets when the normalized transition progress reaches 1.0 (0x8000) and releases below 0.898 (0x7300), and the default arm is the branch taken while the latch is clear.</description>
