    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x91D2; 1 rows x 2 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Native VQ37 fuel-cut activation and release scalar caps. Common-definition Map 1 uses the canonical stock storage. Exact 1ND3B native fuel-cut model at 0x76ad2; selector 0xfffe80ed, shared axis 0x17072. The BSR at coordinator instruction ordinal 223 targets FUN_00076ad2, the first Boolean predicate aggregated by the final fuel-mask coordinator. Its 190-byte implementation preserves the JK78C cap, interpolation, activation, release, and hysteresis structure with target-local storage and RAM state.</description>
